{"ts": 1791254689.567722, "type": "step", "step": 15, "action": "notes_append", "args": {"note_id": "writeup", "text": "\n\n## Build checklist\n- Define the environment explicitly: state, observations, actions, and dynamics.\n- Make clear whether anything is partially observable and whether the agent needs to gather information.\n- Report evaluation with pass^k, not just pass@k.\n- Use at least 3 seeds.\n- Emphasize reliability/repeatability across seeds.\n- If relevant, mention that quiz scores are proxy measures, while retention/repeat performance is closer to the real goal.\n"}, "output": "Appended.", "t": 9, "activity": [], "events": [{"type": "note_edit", "note_id": "writeup", "by": "agent"}], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.27095871991980863, "pass_k": 0.27095871991980863}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9013219651533417, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.4740148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 0.0, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791254689.569267, "type": "step", "step": 16, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Your build needs two main things: (1) define an environment clearly \u2014 state, observations, actions, and dynamics; (2) report evaluation using pass^k on at least 3 seeds. From the readings, pass^k means all k runs succeed, so it\u2019s about reliability, not just one lucky success. A quiz score is only a proxy; the stronger claim is whether the result holds across seeds. I\u2019ll help you tighten the write-up and then you can do a quick follow-up quiz.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3_build"}, "output": "Sent.\n[activity] t=9 messages 4m", "t": 13, "activity": [{"t": 9, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.27095871991980863, "pass_k": 0.27095871991980863}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9013219651533417, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.4740148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": []}}
